// The scalar address-add/concat sequence comes from a scratch-buffer load in
// the lowered chemistry advance kernel. Synthetic live SGPR pairs and explicit
// spill uses isolate its allocator failure mode: BACKEND/005 with failure code
// spill-traffic-register-exhausted. This is not a chemistry computation.

// RUN: with-checks emit low-allocation-json @sgpr_spill_traffic_exhausted amdgpu.sgpr=102

amdgpu.target<gfx942> @target

